", "text": "Circular 02/2026", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 16, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "34a76c8063e9a22f109539289392baa7f4b09296c2e0b45dbe59da8c1852883a", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 2, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026", "rule_ids": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "f59fd8919aa054dfc4e42ec752847194bcbf808b455d0d289dee4e84834d6b3d", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 2, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "hash": "b46031c49b93a9dfb0aa1be68235432dfb142102e574903596d4de7511fc9004", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 2º O § 2º do art. 41, que fixa o teto do acompanhamento continuado, passa a
vigorar com a seguinte redação, mantida a definição de acompanhamento continuado:
“§ 2º ... nessa hipótese o teto é de 2,6 URS por sessão.”", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 220, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "26d9c456635025bc8bcd30a12f255c88a54662dfa0e1619657c45435d7feb536", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 2, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026", "rule_ids": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "ddc209baf6d272a8aa75a1ee7572634822d5600d7001b15e553b06b293366fe6", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 2, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "hash": "6f7ce3bff79b11f54af9b1596893a0fc47c898e1359c486217f1b14ba48f78c6", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 4º Esta Circular não altera o art. 24, que trata da carência para terapias, nem o art.
40, que trata do número máximo de sessões por ano civil, nem o art. 78, que trata da alçada,
nem o valor da URS fixado na Tabela URS do exercício.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 238, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "97bce45dacd346ab3b831fba2adfcb8aa1e546f7f2446e68ea417ea368b263ff", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 2, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026", "rule_ids": "CIRC-02-2026,CIRC-11-2026"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "841dab8390203af7d8974e32841ee293e01c7cc6e745e55d2397672c711a4744", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 2, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "hash": "efe779b42d296081fa715f77ed1b1e074eb713dd7512f7a2dfa4f2f2c7515eff", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 5º Os atendimentos realizados antes do início de vigência desta Circular observam
a redação dada pela Circular 11/2026.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 124, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "a8450d520148f5da8f52032f753460e9af3e2d495a15b0c95d8c90988dc2634c", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 2, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026", "rule_ids": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "98a6cf1fa8d27f2a05ddfc046205e7b036e2629cb43930a704e63166dca12a42", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 2, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "hash": "c7df3b6bbb90ffc9f63ddaaadbcd0378f172b879a70ce871143b11943d0f35be", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 6º A área de operações adequará os sistemas de análise e os roteiros de atendimento
ao disposto nesta Circular quanto aos tetos e à coparticipação, no prazo de 30 (trinta) dias
contados da publicação.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 205, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "706c1ab8fd85fb1d629d473fbdca6e41d43e10c24bd8040ee1d5dde77c1fe2af", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 2, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026", "rule_ids": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "12cb3b3c7b53ccab60fe463de9aaecc3ec366644fdb3339cf2bf5dda4318b1ae", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 2, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "hash": "db5659678385264459ab62906d49e943f9011f92f79e061f61534aeaba1248a6", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 9º A comunicação aos beneficiários será feita pelos canais habituais, sem prejuízo
da publicação desta Circular no portal do beneficiário.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 143, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

