{"id_": "036e7b92df5101270fd875c3f461f6edba87e772dff293efdf5845555f181888", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026", "rule_ids": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "09b392892b45e75119715a05a357e76f5010f461508f8ed38572dd6adadaa419", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "hash": "9b295b8fa39684df0cd8e16cf9239a438eac2284fd8a0056d8891f0e8f512116", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 11. Esta Circular não cria hipótese de cobertura, não amplia o rol assistencial e não
dispensa qualquer dos requisitos do art. 10 do Regulamento Geral.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 156, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "4721ee89ee94c98a4540f8ff5ad170fee8583a89d474c63373e0e4cb9cd42278", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026", "rule_ids": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "1bd8473726ed130bf959ae21cdc602c96be3af2d4330f366314ce1ebcc501d69", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "hash": "617d39380548e67c2628bb52a61f99c63366a19cffdd441548a1fb00611a4043", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 12. As referências desta Circular a artigos do Regulamento Geral consideram a
numeração da edição consolidada em vigor.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 124, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "c65054b879e8278c4f285247edf4acd7027030f036b03bac71f2eb3446588601", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026", "rule_ids": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "4076a3f7018fc3a55ea80cf05cce5b1bae8fd2b91135f9b08babe0b765fe5476", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "hash": "22f35a9649b39ff0a235aa1edc8ab5a01eb414e1080e5a93d05171b86bac0781", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 15. A antecipação de que trata o artigo anterior alcança as sessões realizadas a
partir do início de vigência desta Circular, não retroagindo para exigir documento de sessões já
reembolsadas.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 196, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "23d6a4650695704b653c6c71fe87d10dd77b34ea2971478ad9cd14c5a871a0ca", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026", "rule_ids": "CIRC-02-2026,CIRC-11-2026"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "1c10d429da2f669ddd9d6d9970f03d09f2c01b740c468cf0a2574dfe217cf84a", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "hash": "5df2a3dce94a09244be4db65b38572e5a67152155c0734d739bcf7838dd8374a", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 16. O relatório clínico já apresentado sob a vigência da Circular 11/2026
permanece válido para as sessões subsequentes do mesmo ano civil.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 144, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "719c9c06ca4e1b6579ee677225866fd2ce8a9bd3cad3b85f1d68d4e5469cabb4", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026", "rule_ids": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "0d017f540fe93157c9499aeaeea8588baa6ac59be639661fd2606534d7d15961", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "hash": "6cda7be2695cc6e09efdc22f7457cd5f3756a3f0a3a8c7039e779f00a421bc4d", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 17. A alteração do art. 44 alcança os atendimentos realizados a partir do início de
vigência desta Circular, mantida a ordem de apuração do art. 43 do Regulamento Geral.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 174, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "eac1b3102f969507ca461c8591e80e4a2dd567392fed038cf0f5160cdbb113ab", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026", "rule_ids": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "821c9f0e0c8af1985f8ca50e8838f09a0b8b525795433d0d8f7a2e425207d5c9", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_02_2026.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-04-20", "page": 3, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-02-2026"}, "hash": "4f353982cdc031f89f117de4c3ddac19f636faadb8b72f2060ef21e0ac465d97", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 18. Esta Circular será reavaliada ao término do exercício de 2026.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 71, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "3096efb7e7f6324062dd7314f06fa432b87b7e27319a22d76e27d580ec123679", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "circular_04_2025.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2025-07-01", "page": 1, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-04-2025", "rule_ids": "CIRC-04-2025"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "c1914b558faf65bca0ef22f02960137f2f91bae01eee1835175b306435d6d029", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "circular_04_2025.pdf", "document_type": "circular", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2025-07-01", "page": 1, "source_rule_id": "CIRC-04-2025"}, "hash": "8d00bf438eb1cd717e9bb5f249314e2372d7f0bd0fea663ba3bfb39045d69a39", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 1º O art. 12 do Regulamento Geral de Reembolso passa a vigorar com a seguinte
redação:
“Art. 12. O pedido de reembolso deverá ser protocolado no prazo de 150 (cento e
