{"id_": "0b6718b682a40f5c4318d3fe95c1aff5083b3429adab3508ae4a02789412627a", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 14, "rule_ids": ""}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "cc33ed61231f18f8cf0c1956e0505565cfacf8d672a8b9d908fa5bace0bd457d", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 14}, "hash": "41d6b15816f6718b67bca4f45e2655ed9b2b20e17c1dc584c0ba4bb5b1e069f0", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Regulamento Geral de Reembolso
§ 2º Divergências de até um centavo decorrentes de arredondamento não caracterizam
erro de cálculo.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 130, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "d8976d2b95233c39d6732cbec3673fcc19f0d10b0228db0101e55234a652c8f2", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 14, "rule_ids": "ART-48"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "809876633efe210838de92709808fe7d61142d4ce95604296668b14233d9baae", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 14}, "hash": "c8abbf2a333484bad516fa777a4ca90cc6a945ab573e4165c4de36378ec696b7", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 48. Eventuais tributos retidos na fonte pelo prestador integram o valor pago e são
considerados na apuração.
Parágrafo único. Não integram o valor pago os tributos destacados que tenham sido
restituídos ao beneficiário.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 224, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "f0c9d75ed8067916093fc506e5174a0ed0eca97e4eb50ec99315aad37f6848af", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 14, "rule_ids": "ART-49"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "4e8814f154cd96fcfb8c747d2011ce7c27ce5037b4e9f2410f6a0310d9b5882c", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 14}, "hash": "1c1b336997d5cef0714303209a043ac6e93fcd0f853331c5c3ffac69487aaa28", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 49. O valor da URS é revisto anualmente e divulgado até o último dia útil do
exercício anterior.
Parágrafo único. A revisão do valor da URS não retroage a atendimentos realizados em
exercícios anteriores.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 209, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "07cb2aa70106a002bcceb6b8a287547c989b3040688202b3a2f90cb8289ceb23", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 14, "rule_ids": "ART-50"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "3d5f9ff02b7f80a601713b72d9a256429b0f150b59187d951aa9943dbdbe3049", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 14}, "hash": "2f50248d4a00aed565206b6c7d0df45c7eb95796d4bd22a8165387cc1398ed87", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 50. A tabela vigente e os anexos deste Regulamento são disponibilizados de forma
permanente no portal do beneficiário.
Parágrafo único. A indisponibilidade temporária do portal não suspende os prazos deste
Regulamento.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 223, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "3a618df2e6f52edd19b23cf45ddbb0d397ff83c094d9fcf3ea0051be3b76379d", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 15, "rule_ids": "ART-53"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "32ad1351daded06d74bca12ac74472cc4c8052447c31d3f807eb996271f15340", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 15}, "hash": "de6f48498253fada15a20997b00ab90fb28d082445e17ca51caf95c7d4f4a072", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 53. São excluídos os tratamentos experimentais e os não reconhecidos pelos
conselhos profissionais competentes.
Parágrafo único. A superveniência de reconhecimento pelo conselho competente não
retroage a atendimentos anteriores.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 233, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "790aee3c8bf28763a786c4896c051f4ac8c541a8f0627c63a08b3ca128922894", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 15, "rule_ids": "ART-54"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "f7c3fe09a76f3e4127a44821f3875af2bd321354eec965a957e48b396ddbf8e8", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 15}, "hash": "7358c4ef90e75102847fe722d8794f11445ace753e309e0916035778c850fb98", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 54. São excluídos medicamentos de uso domiciliar, suplementos, cosméticos e
dispositivos de conveniência.
Parágrafo único. Não se aplica a exclusão aos medicamentos e materiais aplicados
durante o próprio ato assistencial e nele discriminados.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 248, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "2c9821e54789d8fed1ca064bff6777bfe89db322a65bd7aad3e36affb1d9c319", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 16, "rule_ids": ""}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "73ae5ec1b44ff719b9e8fcc4541583f35ff6a81b6e822bf0846a099679a080dd", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 16}, "hash": "e0a3dbe530b28ce7c2e344b5b28db245d199e3d7427d150f941fece99252ac83", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Regulamento Geral de Reembolso", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 30, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "823743a60d95822868e6775f5d5a23e4d7c0b4fcf1055893fcf0236d226d3604", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 16, "rule_ids": "ART-56"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "fafbf916670298350998e8488ed695fb23eec76ccfee4cbdfd0f8622815d7e27", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 16}, "hash": "09054db67943c008f819c08a90e8842a4ac75b77483d72134d8aff653290c34d", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 56. Não são reembolsáveis procedimentos não previstos na Tabela URS nem no rol
assistencial do plano contratado.
Parágrafo único. A ausência de previsão na Tabela URS não é sanável por pendência
documental.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 211, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "36833ef75bf639e47c42dc5db0df9fe8deb4595b408b19792ab8c3f0853b444e", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 16, "rule_ids": "ART-57"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "dd89b3e353eddff9bc05ff2d42e46db524cf458cc375f21aa5784dff02895fc4", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 16}, "hash": "a75a7e1ddbbb9e55e6dec015ff70ea422c79df23a610fa1768f07e4242321580", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 57. Não são reembolsáveis taxas administrativas, estacionamento, deslocamento,
hospedagem e despesas de acompanhante.
Parágrafo único. As despesas deste artigo não integram a base de cálculo ainda que
discriminadas no documento fiscal.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 240, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "ee7f944a33f890713ad1a2d412f09abb79e592ddc5df3511eea2a6b1bd07ab02", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 16, "rule_ids": "ART-58,ART-8"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "b10efbe50ea241d50799bb5d3c9d4bcfec538b56225ec6e6600a213f02c8beb3", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 16}, "hash": "ad32b328e7968da88c39a18ff1400cdbd95f223b77a59ed1c3fbfb576aaa09c3", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 58. Não são reembolsáveis despesas de terceiro não beneficiário, ainda que
constem do mesmo documento fiscal.
Parágrafo único. Aplica-se a este artigo o disposto no art. 8º quanto ao sigilo e à vedação
de informação sobre terceiro.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 236, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "de68ae5a64f8e609c3ba641d5c9632569baa248bb8f8a9d3f9f2bef55614ddd0", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 16, "rule_ids": "ART-60"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "68b6d1dafab8a59823c37fe2b07494d763d45f388027623ebcb42a9e9e8c949f", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 16}, "hash": "be0d92e03c8a192dde88365c625ba40add32b402a4a4e577cb0739fa78962488", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 60. Cabe ao beneficiário demonstrar a indicação clínica quando esta for
pressuposto da cobertura.
Parágrafo único. A demonstração faz-se por relatório do profissional assistente
contemporâneo ao atendimento.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 212, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "f9667ce72e27617fc09b4e2b25f43acc5bb634dee0cf885c4861b4237063b71e", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 17, "rule_ids": "ART-61"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "89543f012848a21755d46407d76a832cf9b05c8e4991de749706d737a6ae8c21", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 17}, "hash": "48b7b5e9dd34bdc4599954e02672ab9fdbbc11fb93a092bb5d0ac050ca42f9c5", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 61. A rede credenciada é o conjunto de prestadores contratados pela operadora para
atendimento direto aos beneficiários.
Parágrafo único. A relação da rede credenciada é dinâmica e sua consulta deve ser feita
na data do atendimento.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 237, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "16a589a5cb837070b0a6ac2962d51345df3549ed5678cc9f7af444df5816add0", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 17, "rule_ids": "ART-64"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "e189b61a4327e490f60c16ae894f5716513476a15ca22516bfb1976ae3c7a3d1", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 17}, "hash": "85576ffc48109a7ba1753330bb45d364b6881b7dcd4ca6beef478d1010db67ec", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 64. O descredenciamento é comunicado aos beneficiários com antecedência
mínima de 60 (sessenta) dias.
Parágrafo único. O beneficiário em tratamento continuado com prestador
descredenciado é orientado quanto às alternativas da rede.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 236, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "37b51f0f264f14f2c5b12f9c9a81fbf561bffed5cd613004a9eec80f16f0da93", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 17, "rule_ids": "ART-66"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "b95acfb2963cca03e7661e6ccca27a6e3490741c2ed248a68fad52c09e56f8c1", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 17}, "hash": "72f8cfb2852ccab2c576dbfc5342f2323a47578b2c54357c85ae02bd7d2aeaec", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 66. Não se exige credenciamento do prestador para fins de reembolso por livre
escolha, exigindo-se apenas sua regularidade profissional.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 141, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "4b2cd924cf2ca5ecfba3012b0c1db69abbcc03b98bc278bc142c64daef8d933d", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 18, "rule_ids": ""}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "887c486a83b9bc7ff830250c79a4edf81d95d8ef1bd52892afd86e09ba1ad75c", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 18}, "hash": "ac8c2e632e98a11dac8f6f9b4b6a27e3f2e185f61049dc5c20ba669585c5b37b", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Regulamento Geral de Reembolso
Parágrafo único. A regularidade profissional é aferida na data do atendimento.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 109, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "ccaa586755c0df113e3ab50040c448fb651311d226106ed3368e3ddee1941951", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 18, "rule_ids": "ART-67"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "f59b20ba044e4b057527e471a88d9f6ef2fb8e38d46663967376296365b44d74", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 18}, "hash": "8ee2b873946e2dc9235800540698991751506e5306826e2fc379b7371d04d5ac", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 67. O documento fiscal deve indicar o número de registro do profissional no
conselho competente, conforme a Nota Técnica 02.
Parágrafo único. O registro deve vir acompanhado da sigla do conselho e da unidade
federativa de inscrição.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 237, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "fdc2244dbf6293e62fee5c56b72e2829bb3b023026b756ce1f856d1c751e8ace", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 18, "rule_ids": "ART-70"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "d5fa4ad296ac80af53f98b17d28c7e9dc9bc61c65491b884dae5a30dbac78081", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 18}, "hash": "f8eaf2319f73e3e4e7500b593e2b778e258f1e8e46e8386f9e93610afd727d61", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 70. O atendimento por telessaúde equipara-se ao presencial para todos os efeitos
deste Regulamento.
Parágrafo único. O documento fiscal do atendimento por telessaúde observa os mesmos
requisitos da Nota Técnica 02.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 219, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "396a7f46d8a9710d3941e193f51d9f094ee960073c194a4972f1c2386c6ad2f9", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 18, "rule_ids": "ART-71"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "b9b8be0935163bc57b39ed83fd199b913ba736d5d3756e4b7b4da74f80fa3dd3", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 18}, "hash": "331e48ee26c045b497ff0973f64b0b67f75d3ec0b5eb0e093f51c69a83442722", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 71. A operadora mantém rede referenciada específica para terapias, cuja utilização
é facultativa ao beneficiário.
Parágrafo único. A utilização da rede referenciada de terapias não altera as carências
nem os limites deste Regulamento.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 239, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "a33d1aac688f6dc830070092eaadf7106fceb7b7fa5124574254701574757d3a", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 18, "rule_ids": "ART-72"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "7c0750e5cf694c6cc1508b6a8fa093fe5194aee7dd667b54ed5c11b36abe97c1", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 18}, "hash": "079d0de478186713fdc51ddf957542ef15f6d31cc2ce3ee6edaff2a4493d869b", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 72. A relação atualizada da rede é publicada no portal do beneficiário.
Parágrafo único. A relação publicada tem caráter informativo e é atualizada
periodicamente.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 168, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "d9cf16027b4eb66ea25775fa05d1e45c0e6f32130f1d9918a510899b6ab8419e", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 19, "rule_ids": "ART-18,ART-75"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "84a3d70b9b66ae8b6ca5215c667ee642cd909338503ff535350adc3966456295", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 19}, "hash": "26f6658e2bc5679811677616c577fbfd5b6ed3b263556a2e6e71864ca313e0e2", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 75. Documento ilegível, total ou parcialmente, enseja pendência documental na
forma do art. 18.
Parágrafo único. A pendência por ilegibilidade indica precisamente qual campo não
pôde ser lido.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 197, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "5b3557bcacd8f3a15012e95d4fd931f8560877fa6daf4ab324e5889c07a0ee16", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 20, "rule_ids": ""}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "fc77202480a86b02463d3b9db999e6c3258205094355623395fbeb995f577c0d", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 20}, "hash": "e7b2790d375d64872f1c5e4a217c83df54e46a59744699fca5971e5095461215", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Regulamento Geral de Reembolso", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 30, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "d0e3906e3d8324004c6385162e5ede3ddcedc89adf04fc705217e74c642e60c8", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 20, "rule_ids": "ART-79"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "a9348252b220e2cd3a49f625728422aaff1ac27c391e5fa5c332bfe57e59a69d", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 20}, "hash": "33f50409421b75dea21acb8158814f1b2f3318dfe6f7ee3660dc77fc3936311f", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 79. O protocolo registra a categoria do documento, a decisão, os dispositivos
aplicados e, quando houver, o valor apurado.
Parágrafo único. O registro do protocolo é conservado pelo prazo legal e fica disponível
ao beneficiário.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 233, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "6c35baf6d876faba2d2879f9f9ce4b440ce39fdb9c4f6d7ee501a5ace8969d4c", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 20, "rule_ids": "ART-7,ART-80"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "16221369708cf334496f83af0adc7ed53ed9854c1a2ef04fa96299db6792b29a", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 20}, "hash": "9a15277953978dab6c89775945f44f259623e4b3016086f39da2f4202f0a30e8", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Art. 80. A comunicação ao beneficiário é feita em linguagem simples, observadas as
vedações do art. 7º.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 103, "text_template": "{metadata_str}

{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}

{"id_": "f3da0c210c4143756f7593cf5990cbcad54dbf26e499867ccfd7844ddbd39139", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 21, "rule_ids": "ART-7"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": [], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": [], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "7a2fdbc96b4636635b7448c41c97f5e668618f50bc4a20a5b27b7ffb0f399aa2", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"source": "regulamento_geral.pdf", "document_type": "regulamento", "authority_rank": 3, "effective_date": "2026-01-01", "page": 21}, "hash": "d5f0c87b597637856bc7e9a32c1c63aab0e6f4d85708b2c33dae805ebdf7881c", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "
", "text": "Regulamento Geral de Reembolso
§ 1º A comunicação indica a decisão, os dispositivos aplicados e, quando houver, o valor
apurado e as pendências.
